{"profile":"WHP-STANDING-RECEPTION-1.1.0","component":"Standing Reception (SRP-1), a separate component beside Standing Mark","relationship":"Standing Mark answers what was examined and what bounded findings were issued. Standing Reception answers what was presented, what was received and verified, what decision was made, under whose authority, and what happened afterward. Their records are never combined into one mutable object.","event_kinds":["PRESENTATION","VERIFICATION","RECEPTION","INTERPRETATION","DECISION","AUTHORIZATION","EXECUTION","RECONCILIATION"],"decision_values":["ACCEPT","REJECT","REQUEST_CLARIFICATION","DEFER","ACKNOWLEDGE_WITHOUT_ACCEPTANCE","DECLINE_RELIANCE","PROCEED_TO_AUTHORIZATION"],"reception_statuses":["RECEIVED","VERIFIED","FORWARDED","ACKNOWLEDGED","REJECTED_BY_RECEIVER","UNABLE_TO_PROCESS","PENDING_AUTHENTICATION"],"pinned_issuer_key_ids":["dc872cabbbb942860cb2c4ac97a2a514245e54d69aa8515e80a7ec634c67076f"],"routes":{"contract":{"method":"GET","path":"/v1/reception/contract"},"present":{"method":"POST","path":"/v1/reception/presentations"},"record_event":{"method":"POST","path":"/v1/reception/events"},"get_event":{"method":"GET","path":"/v1/reception/events/{event_id}"},"lifecycle":{"method":"GET","path":"/v1/reception/objects/{object_digest}"},"verify":{"method":"POST","path":"/v1/reception/verify"},"register_key":{"method":"POST","path":"/v1/reception/keys"},"issue_receipt":{"method":"POST","path":"/v1/reception/receipts"}},"guarantees":["Every event is hash-linked, carries a deterministic identity, and is independently auditable by replaying the log.","Reception never mutates the object; the presented bytes digest is recorded and preserved.","Verification is mechanical and never implies acceptance; acceptance never implies authorization; authorization never implies execution; execution never implies settlement.","A rejection never invalidates the original Mark; an acceptance never enlarges it.","No participant can write a consent, decision, or authorization event for another participant: party mismatches are refused, and registered-key acts must verify cryptographically.","The log is verified on every read; tamper fails closed."],"does_not_establish":["EXAMINATION (that is Standing Mark)","RECEIVER_UNDERSTANDING_OR_AGREEMENT beyond recorded receiver events","EXTERNAL_AUTHORITY beyond VERIFIED_BY_REGISTERED_KEY attribution","EXECUTION_OR_SETTLEMENT beyond recorded evidence references","ANY_PAYMENT_OR_PRICING (this component has none)"],"signed_receipts":{"type":"WHP-STANDING-RECEIPT-v1","envelope_profile":"same as a Mark: Ed25519 over the WHP-JCS-I1 bytes of {protected, payload}","signing_key":"the deployment's existing published issuer key (same key that signs Marks); no new key exists","establishes":["AUTHENTICATED_RECEPTION_EVENT","CORRESPONDENCE_OF_RECEIVED_TO_ISSUED_OBJECT"],"does_not_establish":["RECEIVER_UNDERSTANDING","RECEIVER_AGREEMENT","RECEIVER_ACCEPTANCE","AUTHORIZATION_OF_ANY_ACTION","SUBSTANTIVE_CORRECTNESS_OF_THE_EXAMINATION"],"replay":"the same recorded facts return the identical receipt; a request that would produce a different receipt for the same reception is refused"},"payment":"None. This component records and verifies; it has no payment gate, no pricing, and no rails.","environment":"LIVE"}